#: src/driverpage.cpp:430 src/driverpage.cpp:437
msgid "Secure Boot MOK"
msgstr "安全启动 MOK"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:431
msgid ""
"Secure Boot on your computer firmware is disabled or the firmware does not "
"support Secure Boot."
msgstr "你的计算机固件上的安全启动已经关闭或固件不支持安全启动。"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:438
msgid "You have already registered the Secure Boot MOK."
msgstr "您已注册安全启动 MOK。"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:449
msgid "Install akmods-evernight"
msgstr "安装 akmods-evernight"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:450
msgid ""
"akmods-evernight is required to generate and enroll the Secure Boot MOK.\n"
"It is not installed yet. Install it first and then continue with MOK "
"registration?"
msgstr ""
"生成并注册安全启动 MOK 需要 akmods-evernight。\n"
"该软件包尚未安装，是否先安装它，然后继续注册 MOK？"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:458 src/driverpage.cpp:530
msgid "%1 - Installation Log"
msgstr "%1 - 安装日志"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:485
msgid "MOK Configuration Log"
msgstr "MOK 配置日志"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:510
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled. The %1 kernel module must be signed.\n"
"Configure a Machine Owner Key (MOK) now?"
msgstr ""
"安全启动已启用，%1 内核模块必须签名。\n"
"现在配置 MOK（机器所有者密钥）吗？"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:521
msgid "Uninstall Driver"
msgstr "卸载驱动"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:522
msgid "Remove the %1 from this system?"
msgstr "是否从系统中卸载%1？"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:531
msgid "%1 - Removal Log"
msgstr "%1 - 卸载日志"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:557
msgid ""
"%1 was installed successfully. Open System Monitor and wait for the cc1 "
"processes and the subsequent dnf5 process to finish, then reboot to start "
"using it."
msgstr ""
"%1 已成功安装，请打开系统监视器查看等待 cc1 进程和后期的 dnf5 进程完成后，然"
"后重启即可开始使用。"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:564
msgid "%1 was removed successfully."
msgstr "%1 已成功卸载。"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:574
msgid "Set MOK Password"
msgstr "设置 MOK 密码"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:575
msgid ""
"Enter a password for the Machine Owner Key (MOK).\n"
"You will need to enter it after reboot:"
msgstr ""
"请输入 MOK（机器所有者密钥）密码。\n"
"重启后需要输入此密码："

#: src/driverpage.cpp:583
msgid "Confirm MOK Password"
msgstr "确认 MOK 密码"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:584
msgid "Re-enter the password to confirm:"
msgstr "请再次输入密码以确认："

#: src/driverpage.cpp:587
msgid "Password Mismatch"
msgstr "密码不匹配"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:588
msgid "The passwords do not match. MOK configuration was skipped."
msgstr "密码不匹配，已跳过 MOK 配置。"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:598
msgid "MOK Configuration Complete"
msgstr "MOK 配置完成"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:599
msgid ""
"After rebooting, the MOK management screen will appear.\n"
"Choose \"Enroll MOK\" and enter this password:\n"
"\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"重启后将显示 MOK 管理界面。\n"
"请选择“Enroll MOK”并输入以下密码：\n"
"\n"
"%1"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:606
msgid "Operation Cancelled"
msgstr "操作已取消"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:607
msgid ""
"The operation was cancelled before it completed. Changes already made may be "
"partially applied. Please check the log:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"操作在完成前被取消，已做的更改可能只应用了一部分。请检查日志：\n"
"%1"

